    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.notify\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nNotifications text is using `DiagnosticInfo` instead of `MiniNotifyNormal`.\n\nAttaching screenshot and minimal `init.lua` that reproduces the problem.\n\n<img width=\"912\" height=\"740\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7147f24e-c694-464b-9dc0-9b96cd18c1fd\" />\n\n### Reproduction\n\n```lua\nlocal path_package = vim.fn.stdpath('data') .. '/site'\nlocal mini_path = path_package .. '/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim'\nif not vim.loop.fs_stat(mini_path) then\n  vim.cmd('echo \"Installing `mini.nvim`\" | redraw')\n  local clone_cmd = {\n    'git', 'clone', '--filter=blob:none',\n    'https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim', mini_path\n  }\n  vim.fn.system(clone_cmd)\n  vim.cmd('packadd mini.nvim | helptags ALL')\n  vim.cmd('echo \"Installed `mini.nvim`\" | redraw')\nend\n\nvim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, \"DiagnosticInfo\", { fg = \"#ff0000\" })\nvim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, \"MiniNotifyNormal\", { fg = \"#00ff00\" })\nrequire('mini.notify').setup()\n\nvim.notify(\"Hello\")\n```",
